cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DoECISORY in your research, thesis, or publications, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DoECISORY.jl: Design of Experiments with Computational Interactive Sequential Optimization for Response Yield"
abstract: "DoECISORY is an open-source scientific software and web platform for experimental design (DoE), statistical modelling, stoichiometric verification, and multi-objective optimisation, developed in Julia and Dash."
